  "description": "Tired of being bound by her sacred duty, a Saintess enters an unexpected contract with the Demon King. Leaving behind the Holy Temple’s rigid teachings, she settles in the Demon King’s castle in which her permanent residency will be decided by a majority vote. Determined to stay in this castle full of brooding demon brothers, loyal attendants, and opportunities to fulfill her forbidden desires, the Saintess decides to secure her place there through any means possible… including sweet temptation and spicy blackmail. Will she gain the votes and hearts of the demons around her? \n\n(Source: Tappytoon)",
